749569001-36ec2cc1-5848-420b-9a48-3c0cf62939db"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":null},{"content_hash":"8747eb7208f79a42e85332038ba699c39aec5e6c5770220bcd6617b9dd5829f6","event_uuid":"9596e4f5-2209-4b7d-8cc9-5ad629a96b34","position":{"commit_sha":"5c06c64629cc14a15c6c8243b15eb9413d922451","position":"1787337919514504001-9596e4f5-2209-4b7d-8cc9-5ad629a96b34"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":null},{"content_hash":"f83ae6f4f5099276db758c86844a5a82b8e4a03c89ee988bae893bed39ea368b","event_uuid":"f6c3d287-2055-451c-9506-b21d296c284a","position":{"commit_sha":"a2ecdcc033e9069eb1219fe1a21f312917a2161a","position":"1787339067198488001-f6c3d287-2055-451c-9506-b21d296c284a"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":null},{"content_hash":"9f4c029e4609c25ce82e40f6b08434ec4f9f8302a7dfd77c91fc62d5aa11c663","event_uuid":"48dcc869-cb23-4b29-b4f8-c2cf818b8f15","position":{"commit_sha":"8f4df6537ea7938d2b5570b34ce819b0c39305a9","position":"1787339164020310001-48dcc869-cb23-4b29-b4f8-c2cf818b8f15"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":null},{"content_hash":"463b3fe2a60ed1a0d0fb6019cad2e1f5bcf4399b215f0e357f450ab49f561501","event_uuid":"02becda7-92ef-4e18-a238-030eca81967b","position":{"commit_sha":"27fe8abb934cae33968ab1a46c95b1e922037539","position":"1787339784123645001-02becda7-92ef-4e18-a238-030eca81967b"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":null}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Execution tree has three dependency-ordered stories. F01 defines policy and relocates the generated inventory. F06 rebuilds navigation. F07 expands deterministic link validation. Worktree is /Users/joeoakhart/docs-foundation-enforcement on branch docs-foundation-enforcement at 72dd685bd8. Each change will pass LLM-Review and Verified in Gerrit before submission to main. Project rules govern the landing order.","timestamp":1787336959106825001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"F01 plan review returned BLOCK for one omitted test assertion. The plan now names test_contributing_points_at_the_generated_artifacts_table, requires the new generated-inventory pointer, and uses independent acceptance criteria. The worktree remains unchanged.","timestamp":1787337403749569001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Second F01 plan review found a direct table consumer outside the shared helper. The revised ticket inventories every consumer and all stale catalog documentation in the marker test. The parent epic now assigns the lossless relocation to F01 and distinguishes it from deferred F05 generation. The worktree remains unchanged.","timestamp":1787337919514504001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"F01 claimed after signed plan reviews for the leaf and epic.\n\nTest contract card\n\n- Authoritative contract: cosies-pegmatite-ibex and ticket forworn-zanyish-narwhale require the catalog row sets, regenerate commands, marker checks, contributor pointer, policy pointers, and eight policy roles.\n- Trigger preconditions: docs/generated-artifacts.md and docs/documentation-policy.md are absent while tests and CONTRIBUTING.md still target the docs/README.md catalog.\n- Production path: the focused marker test reads committed documentation and contributor guidance. The existing docs-index test exercises repository integration.\n- Test tier: in-process contract tests are sufficient for committed file contracts. The existing checker supplies the repository-level integration oracle.\n- Observable postcondition: catalog consumers read the new file, registry values remain unchanged, required pointers resolve, and the docs index passes.\n- Negative control: generated markers and hand-authored parity classifications remain unchanged.\n- CI gate: the focused unit tests run under the project test gate.","timestamp":1787339067198488001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"F01 RED confirmed. The focused marker module collected 22 tests. Fourteen passed and eight failed for the intended missing behavior. The failures were the absent catalog, absent policy, stale contributor anchor, and missing policy or catalog pointers. No import, fixture, or collection failure occurred. Gate mapping is tests/unit/test_generated_surface_markers.py under the project test gate.","timestamp":1787339164020310001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"F01 held-out validation is GREEN. The restored focused module collected and passed 22 tests. The implementation agent saw 18 visible tests and reported one implementation attempt. The mutation check removed the Protected evidence role from the policy and caused test_policy_defines_all_documentation_roles to fail on the missing role. The policy row was restored. Full diff and project gate validation remain in progress.","timestamp":1787339784123645001}],"created_at":1787336932832469001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"28c928ed-e994-476d-8ee3-3763c6b905a2","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"b4ec-b899-bb50-4970"}],"description":"","env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[["relates_to","b4ec-b899-bb50-4970"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":[],"ticket_id":"baf2-1862-c8d3-4e1d","ticket_type":"session_log","title":"Implement approved documentation foundation and enforcement","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["32e28c2b-a1fa-4a70-afa5-d5ef89df44f3","28c928ed-e994-476d-8ee3-3763c6b905a2","615d7262-b2d6-4ddc-9ea9-d7615638e34e","36ec2cc1-5848-420b-9a48-3c0cf62939db","9596e4f5-2209-4b7d-8cc9-5ad629a96b34","f6c3d287-2055-451c-9506-b21d296c284a","48dcc869-cb23-4b29-b4f8-c2cf818b8f15","02becda7-92ef-4e18-a238-030eca81967b"]},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1787339784123645002,"uuid":"f8a190f4-4d36-4c74-9728-75c70c11fe89"}